// RUN: %target-sil-opt -enable-sil-verify-all -autodiff-closure-specialization %s -o - | %FileCheck %s
//
// Unexpected direct tape field with a nested tuple projection. Source tuple
// captures are scalarized or nested inside replacement capture tuples at the
// two ADCS pipeline points; no source trigger for this exact shape was found.
// Reject it before synthesizing enums or replacing the old payload projection.
// CHECK-NOT: _AD__{{.*}}_spec
// CHECK-LABEL: sil [ossa] @$s3outyycfU6_7myfoo08L_yS2f_SftFTJrSUpSr
// CHECK: thin_to_thick_function
// CHECK: return
